         * parameter will trigger WordPress to dispatch an internal sub request and load the object within the same request
         * under the `_embedded` response property.
         *
         * e.g;
         *   [
         *       [
         *           'rel' => 'acf:post',
         *           'href' => 'https://example.com/wp-json/wp/v2/posts/497',
         *           'embeddable' => true,
